+ * @param masterfd Filedescriptor of the exported file
+ * @param masteroff Offset in the exported file matching offset a
+ * @param a The offset in the export where the read should start
+ * @param buf The buffer to read into
+ * @param len The size of buf
+ * @return The number of bytes read, or -1 in case of an error
